<title>HUNGARY: CESI index closes at 1.705.48 pts, down 2.53.</title>
<headline>CESI index closes at 1.705.48 pts, down 2.53.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index eased 0.15 percent or 2.53 points to finish at 1,705.48 points on Thursday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
